# The menu's volume at 0 (side track L, PLAN.md L.2): the settings
# register (Platform.Ps.Link, PsSettings; 0xF01001), played on the PS link
# by the Verilator harness (make resim SIM_PS=this file). With a tone ROM
# and --expect-quiet 0, the tone must be gone from the sound output.
# Format: platform/sim/ps.zig.
bytes 0xF01001 00
